      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Columbia hosts one of Tennessee's largest collections of antebellum homes, earning the county title \"Antebellum Homes Capital of Tennessee.\".",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Columbia%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The city houses one of only two surviving residences of 11th U.S. President James K. Polk, a rare link to early national history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
